  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup self-rising flour",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "4 Granny Smith apples, cored and sliced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x9-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gOXg-P6phRvoIkJXeoIilzf2TqM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233069-apple-cobbler-crumble-ddmfs-0026-4x3-step01-61ab929f89c8456598c96ea7206e051c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233069/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend flour, sugar, butter, and cinnamon together in a large bowl with a pastry blender until crumbly. Reserve 3/4 cup mixture for topping.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4UBuHtpbFEHNgMSzBfNJkJPKIYc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233069-apple-cobbler-crumble-ddmfs-0029-4x3-step02-2f5fcc7745c04cc3a30173089dbfa3cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233069/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle a light layer of flour mixture into the prepared baking dish; top with a layer of apples. Continue to alternate layers of flour mixture and apples, ending with apples. Sprinkle with reserved 3/4 cup flour mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/97PgEHmYZceIQZgt4YlHNcLl6Yc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233069-apple-cobbler-crumble-ddmfs-0031-4x3-step03-f3d287ffbf5f477881643d6b74e7cbee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233069/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until apples are tender and topping is lightly browned, 30 to 35 minutes. Let cool for 10 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_0Z92Q2sm5I4LNPR-wW9qVRnok4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233069-apple-cobbler-crumble-ddmfs-0090-4x3-step04-4a922fe6650849088741f0f9ccb4f378.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233069/step_04.webp"
    }
  ],
